<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="SNG" style="id">- Toma Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Guyei Pagai Guyei Pɛ Ba</para>
  <para style="toc1">Guyei Pagai Guyei Pɛ Ba</para>
  <para style="toc2">Guyei Pagai Guyei Pɛ Ba</para>
  <para style="toc3">GPG</para>
  <para style="mt1">Guyei Pagai Guyei Pɛ Ba</para>
  <para style="imt">Sɛʋɛi lɔɔzeizuʋɛ ma woo mɔungiti</para>
  <para style="ip">Sɛʋɛi é ga Guyei Pagai Guyei Pɛ Ba, toɠa ga Izilayɛle nuiti ta-nɛɛbɛ ɠidafaawu wuye zɛʋɛi, nii tanisu sɛʋɛi ɠɛɛ nu mɔinmɔin ge sɛʋɛai. Eɓulu wooi zu «guyeiti ta-wuyei» wooi wo pelei ta ʋe, nii poluʋɛ ga tɔ ɠa pagai guyei pɛ ba, eɠɛʋelei nu a ɠɛɛ la ma «masagiti ta-masagi», é dɛɛzu la ga tɔ ɠa é ga masa golai. Sɛʋɛi tɔɔzeiʋɛ ga é masagi Salomɔn laaseigi wo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="SNG 1:1">1:1</ref></char>) kɛlɛ naa la bosu ga tɔ ɠa é sɛʋɛai. Toɠa zoo ɠɛɛzu ga nu ɠili ka é sɛʋɛai, nii a kɛ é Salomɔn maawui. Faaɠwɛ nu wolai ti la kwɛɛ yeeɠɛɠalai nii sɛʋɛi ɠɛai ma, kɛlɛ tanisu naa ɠɛɛʋɛ siɛgi zu Salomɔn ɠɛni la masadai zu, é zo kona untaaʋuugɔ puulɔfela (970) ɠɛɠala ma, é yei untaaʋuugɔ puusaʋagɔ maazu ɠilagi (931) ma, aisa Yesu Kilista ʋa zɔlɔɔ. Tama gaalɛɛʋɛ ba ná yee ʋolu ʋelei.</para>
  <para style="ip">Guyei Pagai Guyei Pɛ Ba, naa ɠa nɛɛbɛ ɠitei maamusɛzu. Sɛʋɛi lɔɔzeizu é li gaaɓelasu, zunu ɠila ta anzanu ɠila ta su ɛsɛ ge ɗa koozu ɠisiɛi ʋagɔi wo bɔɔlai ma. Ná tanigaa, ti-wɔɔlaiti ta-vaiti zɔɠɔzu lɛɛzu, ti lati ti ʋɔɔkpɔ ta-woozunɛɛi ʋa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="SNG 6:1">6:1</ref></char>). Faaɠwɛ nuiti bɔɔlɔzu zoloogɛ ma, ti ɠɛ ma sɛʋɛi nii ma woo ɓiigi ɠa gaaɠwɛsu lɔsaʋai zu puuzu lɔɔlugɔ é li dɔfelai zu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="SNG 8:5-7">8:5-7</ref></char>). Miná anzanui ɠɛɛʋɛ ma nɛɛbɛi zɛbɛi wɔɔlɔʋɛ ga saai ɠɛʋele. Nɛɛbɛi ɠa é ga anii nii sɛbɛi wola wɔɔlɔai, nii nu a zoo gaaɠaazu, ta nu la zoo ga sakpesu, eɠɛʋelei nɔ saai la. Tanisu naa ɠa é kɛai ná zeizu ɠɛai la saʋa, anzanui ɗa ɠɛ nuiti ma, ti mina nɛɛbɛi maaloɠa, aisa é ʋa nɛɛ bɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="SNG 2:7">2:7</ref>; <ref loc="SNG 3:5">3:5</ref>; <ref loc="SNG 8:4">8:4</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="iot">Unsosuʋɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Sɛʋɛi ma ungi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="SNG 1:1">1:1</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Kidafaawu mɔungi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="SNG 1:2-2:7">1:2—2:7</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Kidafaawui velesiɛi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="SNG 2:8-3:5">2:8—3:5</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Kidafaawui zaʋasiɛi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="SNG 3:6-5:1">3:6—5:1</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">5. Kidafaawui naanisiɛi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="SNG 5:2-6:3">5:2—6:3</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">6. Kidafaawui lɔɔlusiɛi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="SNG 6:4-8:4">6:4—8:4</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">7. Kidafaawui lɔzitasiɛi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="SNG 8:5-14">8:5—8:14</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="SNG 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 1:1"/>Guyei nii pagai guyei pɛ ba. Salomɔn ná-guyei.<verse eid="SNG 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="sp">(Anzanui)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 1:2"/>Ee, nɛ̀ɛnɛ ga è-laaʋɛ, è nɛ̀ɛnɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:2">Ɗa-nɛɛbɛi ɠa sòsu, é leʋe dɔɔi ʋa.<verse eid="SNG 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 1:3"/>Ɗa-wulɔiti kugi wola nɛɛʋɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:3">È-laaseigi ɠulaʋɛ ga gulɔi nii maku nɛɛnɛgi liizu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:3">naa ɠa é kɛɛzu anzalopoiti ti wɔinzu la ga ɗe.<verse eid="SNG 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 1:4"/>Sò zèei ʋa, è mɛ̀ɛn, de ɓizɛ ʋɔɔma!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:4">Masagi lɛɛʋɛ ga ze ná-pɛlɛ ɠoozu ʋɛlɛiti bu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:4">De ɠoozunɛ, de ɠɔkɔ è-zaalai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:4">de ɗa-nɛɛbɛi ma ɠoozunɛɛi ɠula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:4">nii é nu zosu, é leʋe dɔɔi ʋa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:4">Gaama ɠa anzalopoiti zea ga ti wɔin ga ɗe.<verse eid="SNG 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 1:5"/>Zeluzalɛme anzalopoiti, kɔ̀lɔgi maalɛitɛigɛ, kɛlɛ pàgɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:5">eɠɛʋelei Kedaal zeɠe ɠota maalɛitɛigiti ti la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:5">ta Salomɔn ná-seɠe zuɠooza gola zuʋua ʋapagiti.<verse eid="SNG 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 1:6"/>À mina wɛlɛ màalɛitɛi pelei nɔ ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:6">ga tɛi gàlaai foloi ʋɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:6">Kɛ̀ɛlointi ka ti yiiɠaawanani mà,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:6">ti ɠɛ, gè ɗa wɛlɛ leezɛn ɓeleiti ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:6">Gè la wɛlɛni nà ɓɔɠɔi nà-leezɛn ɓelei ma.<verse eid="SNG 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 1:7"/>Mini ɠa è ɗa-ʋaala kpulugi makɛsu ná?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:7">Ee, zìima nui, ná lɛ ga ze kae,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:7">mini ɠa ná ga ta-looɠo bosuʋɛ è ya folo gaalɔgai?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:7">Nii a kɛ gè mina ɠɛ ga teʋeteʋe nu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:7">è-wɔɔlaiti ta-ʋaala kpulugiti koba.<verse eid="SNG 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="sp">(Zunui)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 1:8"/>Ni è la naa zuɠwɛɛni, ɗɛi è ʋagai anzanuiti kpein saama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:8">ɠula, è ʋilɛ baalagiti kɔɠɔ ɠoba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:8">ɗa-woli yiʋoiti kɔnɔkula</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:8">togani makɛ nuiti ta-ɠotaiti kobaʋɛti.<verse eid="SNG 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 1:9"/>Ee, zìima anzanui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:9">è ʋagɛ eɠɛ soo zaai nii Falaɠɔn ná-wotoloiti giliai ba.<verse eid="SNG 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 1:10"/>È-ɠomagiti gola ʋagɛ ɗa-woizu anigiti saama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:10">È-ɠɔgi ɠeeluai ga pagɔ ɗa-ɠɔbu anigiti saama.<verse eid="SNG 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 1:11"/>Da zanu goizu anigiti kpɛtɛzu è ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:11">ti ʋɛlupɛlugai ga walii.<verse eid="SNG 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="sp">(Anzanui)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 1:12"/>Nà-masagi ɠɛai ma daazuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:12">nà-naal gulɔi maku nɛɛnɛgi ɠɛni ɠulazu.<verse eid="SNG 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="SNG 1:13"/>Nɛ̀ɛbɛ nui ɠa bɛ̀ ga miilegi ma liʋɛi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:13">toɠa ɲiizu piin ɲìimiiti zɔɠɔzuʋɛ.<verse eid="SNG 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="SNG 1:14"/>Eɠɛʋelei gulu ʋuai yisɔyisɔgiti ti la En-Gedi leezɛn ɓelei zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:14">ʋele ɠana nɛ̀ɛbɛ nui la bɛ̀.<verse eid="SNG 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="sp">(Zunui)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="SNG 1:15"/>Ee, è ʋagɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:15">È ʋagɛ, zìima anzanui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:15">è-ɠaazuɠɛzɛiti pagɛ eɠɛ poopo kolegiti.<verse eid="SNG 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="sp">(Anzanui)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="SNG 1:16"/>Ɗa ɓalaa è ʋagɛ ɗɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:16">Nɛ̀ɛbɛ nui, ɗa nu ɛnɛkɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:16">De laa ʋetei ɠa ga tufa lɛnugi.<verse eid="SNG 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="SNG 1:17"/>Sɛdele guluiti ti ɠɛ de maazu ga dakai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 1:17">sipɛlɛ guluiti ti ɠɛ ga da-ʋɛlɛi ma leʋesuiti.<verse eid="SNG 1:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="SNG 2"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 2:1"/>Nà ga tufai, nii é ʋuazu Salon nɛmɛi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:1">nà ga pɛtu su wulɛgi.<verse eid="SNG 2:1"/></para>
  <para style="sp">(Zunui)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 2:2"/>Ʋelei bulɛgi a ɗa ɠɛ la ɠaingiti saama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:2">ʋele ɠana zìima anzanui la anzalopoiti saama.<verse eid="SNG 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="sp">(Anzanui)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 2:3"/>Ʋelei nɔ pɔme gului la dɔɓɔ wuluiti saama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:3">ʋele ɠana nɛ̀ɛbɛ nui la zinipoiti saama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:3">Nɛɛʋɛ bɛ̀ ga gè zei ná-niinigi wu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:3">gaawaai nɛɛʋɛ dàaʋɛ.<verse eid="SNG 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 2:4"/>É lɛa ga ze fɛti ɠula ʋɛlɛi wu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:4">ná-poogi é màazu, naa ɠa ga nɛɛbɛi.<verse eid="SNG 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 2:5"/>À kɔ̀nɔkula ga leezɛn vɔɔiti, nii a kɛ gè zɛbɛ zɔlɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:5">à kɔ̀da yɛɓɛ ga pɔmegiti, gè gaaɓaa zɔlɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:5">tɔɔzei gè zeeɓɛa ga nɛɛbɛi.<verse eid="SNG 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 2:6"/>Kɔʋɛzu ʋele yeei ɠa é daazu nɔ̀ungi wu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:6">é zeezai velevele mà.<verse eid="SNG 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 2:7"/>Zeluzalɛme anzalopoiti, nà wo maanɛɛnɛzu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:7">dopaiti ta goegiti daaseigi zu, ti dɔɓɔi zu:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:7">À mina nɛɛbɛi maaloɠa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:7">à mina maaloɠa, aisa é ʋa nɛɛ bɛ.<verse eid="SNG 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 2:8"/>À woilo dɛɛ, nɛ̀ɛbɛ nui wooi ɠanu, é lɛɛzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:8">tɔ ɠanu é ʋaazu ga ɓudɛa gize goiti ta gize wolaiti maazu.<verse eid="SNG 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 2:9"/>Nɛ̀ɛbɛ nui ɠulaʋɛ ga dopai ɓaa goe ziʋoi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:9">Wɛlɛ ba loni gá-zasai ʋoluʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:9">é ɗa wɛlɛ gá-venɛtɛlɛ laaʋɛti.<verse eid="SNG 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 2:10"/>Nɛ̀ɛbɛ nui ɓɔɛ pɔ̀, é ɠɛ mà:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:10">«Wuzeɠe, zìima anzanui, nà-nu ʋagɔi, ʋa!<verse eid="SNG 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 2:11"/>Samai leʋega,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:11">tonai looɠoga, é leʋega.<verse eid="SNG 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 2:12"/>Zooi zu ná pɛ tufaiti ti ʋua,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:12">guye loo ziɛgi zeelia.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:12">Nu kpumagoi wooi mɛnisu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:12">é ɗa guyei loo ada-yooi zu.<verse eid="SNG 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="SNG 2:13"/>Kooleɠoole gwaaiti ti ɗa ɓɔi niina ti-ma wuluiti ga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:13">leezɛn ɓeleiti ti teʋea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:13">ti-maku nɛɛnɛgi ɗa ɠula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:13">Wuzeɠe, zìima anzanui, nà-nu ʋagɔi, ʋa!<verse eid="SNG 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="SNG 2:14"/>Ɗɛi è ga nà-poopo kolegi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:14">è-laɠagi logai fasa yeɠeiti su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:14">ta ada zɛlɛgiti ma lɔɔɠuzuʋɛti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:14">Ɠaazuʋɛ ɠula lɛɛ, gè è-ɠaazuʋɛ ɠa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:14">ta gè è woomɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:14">mazɔlɔɔ è-wooi wola nɛɛʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:14">è-ɠaazuʋɛ wola ʋagai.<verse eid="SNG 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="SNG 2:15"/>«À wansai niiti so dɛɛ gi ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:15">wansa yiʋoi niiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:15">tiya ɠa ti faa zuɠoloɠologi ɠɛɛzu gá-leezɛn ɓeleiti su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:15">tama naati ti teʋea.»<verse eid="SNG 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="SNG 2:16"/>Nɛ̀ɛbɛ nui ɠa zèema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:16">nà ɓalaa gè ɠɛ zeema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:16">toɠa ná-baalagiti kɔnɔkulazu bulɛgiti saama.<verse eid="SNG 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="SNG 2:17"/>Kpɔkɔ ɠaalɛilɛigi ɠa zeelina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:17">niinigiti su ɠa wɔɔlɔna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:17">ɠale ma, nɛ̀ɛbɛ nui, è ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:17">veɠa ɓɔɠɔ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 2:17">eɠɛ dopai ɓaa goe ziʋoi a ɠɛ ada zɛlɛgiti.<verse eid="SNG 2:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="SNG 3"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 3:1"/>Zɛ̀gɛ laani nà-betei zu kpidii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:1">gè ɗa zìima nui ɠaiziɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:1">gè gaiziɛʋɛ, kɛlɛ gè la kaani.<verse eid="SNG 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 3:2"/>Gè ɠɛni ɓɔɠɔ ma: «Nà wuzeɠezu mu, gè taai lati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:2">gè leʋe koi yɔɠɔzuʋɛti, ta maaɓɔ bosuʋɛti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:2">gè zìima nui ɠaiziɛ.»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:2">Gè gaiziɛni, kɛlɛ gè la kaani.<verse eid="SNG 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 3:3"/>Gi ɠomini gá taa makɛ nuiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:3">ti ɗa lati taai ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:3">Gè ti ɠaazaɠani ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:3">«Wo la zìima nui ɠaani bɛ̀?»<verse eid="SNG 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 3:4"/>Gè leʋeni nɔ ti ʋa feya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:4">gè zìima nui ɠa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:4">Gè soni zeei ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:4">gè la mɔ ɓeni ba pɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:4">eyɛsu gè lɛɛ la</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:4">sɔ̀lɔɔ deei ná-pɛlɛi wu.<verse eid="SNG 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 3:5"/>Zeluzalɛme anzalopoiti, nà wo maanɛɛnɛzu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:5">dopaiti ta goegiti daaseigi zu, ti dɔɓɔi zu:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:5">À mina nɛɛbɛi maaloɠa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:5">à mina maaloɠa, aisa é ʋa nɛɛ bɛ.<verse eid="SNG 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 3:6"/>Ɓɛ ɠanu, é ɠulazu teʋebai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:6">é ɗa lɛ eɠɛ abu luulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:6">makugi nɛai eɠɛ miilegi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:6">naa ʋɛɛ ansansegi ma zii pɛ ba?<verse eid="SNG 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 3:7"/>Salomɔn laa ʋetei ʋe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:7">maaɠakugai ga zɛbɛsu nu ʋuulɔzita (60),</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:7">Izilayɛle zɛbɛsu nuiti saama.<verse eid="SNG 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 3:8"/>Boɠa zɔkpɔi ɠa ti pɛ zea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:8">ti ɠalagai ga kɔɔi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:8">Ɛsɛ saamaɠiliʋɛ ga ná-kɔɔɠɔ zɔɔla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:8">kpidii zu vaaɓaagiti daalɔɠɔma.<verse eid="SNG 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 3:9"/>Ti Salomɔn zeɠe ɓɔkpɔgi ɓɛtɛʋɛ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:9">ga Liɓan wului.<verse eid="SNG 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 3:10"/>Ti ma ɓɛdɛgiti kpɛtɛʋɛ ga walii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:10">tiɓisuʋɛ ɠɛ ga zanugi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:10">ti seɠe ɓɔkpɔgi ɓɛtɛ ga zalama zeɠei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:10">Zeluzalɛme anzalopoiti ti suʋu ga nɛɛbɛi.<verse eid="SNG 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 3:11"/>Ee, Zeluzalɛme anzalopoiti, à ɠula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:11">wo masagi Salomɔn ɠa, masa bɔɔlɔgi unma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:11">nii dee dɔɔni unma, ná-vulu ɠɛɛ voloi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 3:11">yeei koozunɛɛi ziimaʋɛ pɛ daaveni la.<verse eid="SNG 3:11"/></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="SNG 4"/>
  <para style="sp">(Zunui)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 4:1"/>Ee, è ʋagɛ zìima anzanui, ee, è ʋagɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:1">È-ɠaazuɠɛzɛiti kulaʋɛ ga poopo kolegiti</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:1">ɗa-ɠaazu lɔɔɠu zeɠei ʋoluʋɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:1">Ɗɔundeɠaiti kulaʋɛ ga boli ɓulugiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:1">niiti ti yeizu Galaade ɠizei ɠɔbuʋɛ.<verse eid="SNG 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 4:2"/>È-ɲiigaiti ta gàazu eɠɛ baala saa ɓulugi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:2">niiti ti maaleɠaiti gaaleʋeai nɔ feya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:2">ti ɗa zeɠe maagba wosuʋɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:2">Ta ʋolu ga felefele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:2">tanɔpɛ ge la ʋolu ɠila.<verse eid="SNG 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 4:3"/>È-lakɔlɔgiti kpɔiʋɛ eɠɛ seɠe zakpa ɓɔigi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:3">è-laaʋɛ wola ʋagɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:3">È-ɠomagiti kɛɛʋɛ eɠɛ gelenade gulu waa ɓɔigi ma ʋalisuiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:3">ɗa-ɠaazu lɔɔɠu zeɠei ʋoluʋɛ.<verse eid="SNG 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 4:4"/>È-ɠɔgi ɠiliɠiligɛ eɠɛ Davide ná-siɠi gaaɠoozagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:4">kɔɔɠɔ zɛpɛ waagilagiti (1.000) ti zɛlɛni ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:4">ti kpein ti ɠɛ ga kɔɔɠuluɓaiti ta-ɠɔɔɠɔ zɛpɛ kiliɠiligiti.<verse eid="SNG 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 4:5"/>È-ɲiimi felegɔiti kulaʋɛ ga dopa yiʋo felegɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:5">eɠɛ dopa zaai ma yiʋo felegɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:5">ti tufai miizu bulɛgiti saama.<verse eid="SNG 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 4:6"/>Kpɔkɔ ɠaalɛilɛigi ɠa zeelina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:6">niinigiti su ɠa wɔɔlɔna,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:6">wɔin ɠa mà ga gè li miile gizei ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:6">ansanse gizei ma.<verse eid="SNG 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 4:7"/>È ɓɛtɛ ʋelei pɛ pagɛ, zìima anzanui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:7">nɛɛʋuzu nɔpɛ ge la è ʋa.<verse eid="SNG 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 4:8"/>Zeɠe Liɓan, è ʋa pɔ̀, ɗɛi è ga ànza ɓeai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:8">zeɠe Liɓan, è ʋa pɔ̀!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:8">Yei, è zeɠe Amana ɠizei unmaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:8">naa ʋɛɛ Seniil gizei, ta Ɠɛɛlɛmɔn gizei ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:8">zalaiti ɲiizuʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:8">ta kɔiiti ta-ɠizeiti.<verse eid="SNG 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 4:9"/>Ɗa wɛlɛna bà nɔ ɠila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:9">naa ɠa kɛ̀ɛzu unga wuulee,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:9">anzalopoi, ɗɛi è ga ànza ɓeai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:9">ɗa-ɠɔbu ani gila kpegi ɠa kɛ̀ɛzu ga ɗa-luɔi.<verse eid="SNG 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 4:10"/>Ɗa-wɔinlai wola ɠaanɛɛʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:10">ee, anzalopoi, ɗɛi è ga ànza ɓeai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:10">toɠa nu zosu é leʋe dɔɔi ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:10">ɗa-wulɔ maku nɛɛnɛgiti makugi nɛɛʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:10">é leʋe siɛma wulɔi mɔtai pɛ ba.<verse eid="SNG 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 4:11"/>Ɗɛi è ga ànza ɓeai, è-lakɔlɔgiti ta kɔin gulɔi ɓɛtɛzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:11">kɔin gulɔi ta nɔnɔi ta ɠulazu è-nɛgi wu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:11">È ɠɔba zeɠeiti kugi ɠulaʋɛ ga Liɓan wului ɠugi.<verse eid="SNG 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 4:12"/>Anzalopoi, ɗɛi è ga ànza ɓeai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:12">ɗa ɠa è ga nà-kpelei sasai ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:12">ziɛungi daaɠulugai kpe.<verse eid="SNG 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="SNG 4:13"/>È-ɠaalaagiti ta ga gelenade kpelei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:13">nii gaawaaiti gola ʋagai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:13">naa ʋɛɛ ɠɛneegi ta naalegi ʋa,<verse eid="SNG 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="SNG 4:14"/>naalegi ta safalain,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:14">naa ʋɛɛ seeli kpaɠa maku nɛɛnɛgi ta kanɛlegi ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:14">ta gului ma zii pɛ kugi nɛai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:14">naa ʋɛɛ alɔwɛgi ʋa ta miilegi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:14">é ʋɛɛ ansanse pagɔi kpein ba.<verse eid="SNG 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="SNG 4:15"/>Ɗa ɠa è ga nà-ziɛungi nà-kpeleiti faa ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:15">kɔtuɗɛi nii é yeizu, é ɗa zeɠe Liɓan.<verse eid="SNG 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="sp">(Anzanui)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="SNG 4:16"/>À ɠula ɲiimɛnii zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:16">lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu ɠɔʋɛzu ʋelei, ta nu yeezazu ʋele viilɛiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:16">wo ʋa, wo ʋu nà-kpelei ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:16">nii a kɛ maku nɛɛnɛgi ɠula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:16">Nɛ̀ɛbɛ nui lɔɔna ná-kpelei zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 4:16">é ma wulu waa nɛɛnɛgi ta mi.<verse eid="SNG 4:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="SNG 5"/>
  <para style="sp">(Zunui)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 5:1"/>Nà ga lɔ nà-kpelei zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:1">ee, anzalopoi, ɗɛi è ga ànza ɓeai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:1">gè nà-miilegi ɠula ta tufa maku nɛɛnɛgiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:1">gè nà-kɔin sɛpɛgi mi, ta ma wulɔi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:1">gè nà-dɔɔi ta nà-nɔnɔi ɓɔle.</para>
  <para style="sp" vid="SNG 5:1">(Bɔɔlamaiti)</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:1">Bɔ̀ɔlaiti, à daami wo, wo ɓɔɔle.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:1">Nɛɛbɛ nu felegɔiti, à dɔɔi ɓɔle, é wo zo.<verse eid="SNG 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="sp">(Anzanui)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 5:2"/>Gè ɠɛa ɲiizu, kɛlɛ zìi ɠɛa ɠaazu ɠa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:2">gè nɛ̀ɛbɛ nui woomɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:2">é ɗa pɛlɛi laaloɠa, é ɗa ɠɛ mà:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="SNG 5:2"/>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:2">«Pɛlɛi laalao, anzalopoi, zìima anzanui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:2">nà-poopo kolegi, ɗɛi è ɠaavɔnigai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:2">Mazɔlɔɔ nɔ̀ungi yɛɓɛa ga duɓui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:2">kpidi ɗɛ ɠilagilagi é ʋilɛsu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:2">naa nɔ̀undeɠaiti zɛɓɛa.»<verse eid="SNG 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 5:3"/>Gè nà-seɠei ɠulaa ɠɔba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:3">nà too ɠale ʋolu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:3">Gè kɔ̀ɠɔiti maagbaa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:3">nà ti nɔɠɔzu ɠale ʋolu?<verse eid="SNG 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 5:4"/>Nɛ̀ɛbɛ nui ɠa yeeleʋesu fenɛtɛlɛ laaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:4">kɔɔlɛ ɓooi ɗa yei ga ze.<verse eid="SNG 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 5:5"/>Gè wuzeɠea ga gè pɛlɛi laalao nɛ̀ɛbɛ nui ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:5">miile gulɔ maku nɛɛnɛgi yeiɗa zèei ta zèeɓeɠaiti zɔɠɔzuʋɛti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:5">gè ɗa pɛɛ sɔɠɔgi ʋa.<verse eid="SNG 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 5:6"/>Gè pɛlɛi laalaoga nɛ̀ɛbɛ nui luɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:6">kɛlɛ é lia, é la mɔ ná,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:6">gè ɠɛ unga wuulee.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:6">Gè ɠulani gaiziɛ vai ma, kɛlɛ gè la kaani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:6">Gè ta nɔ lolini, é la gòoɠaaʋoteni.<verse eid="SNG 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 5:7"/>Gi ɠomini gá taa makɛ nuiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:7">ti ɗa lati taai ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:7">Ti dòɠani, ti màawana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:7">ti nà-pɛɛkɔmai ɠula zèa.<verse eid="SNG 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 5:8"/>Ee, Zeluzalɛme anzalopoiti, nà wo ɠaazaɠasu:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:8">Wa nɛ̀ɛbɛ nui ɠaana, leeni ɠa wo bosu ma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:8">À ɠɛ ma nɛɛbɛ zeeɓɛi ɠa é bà.<verse eid="SNG 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="sp">(Zeluzalɛme anzalopoiti)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 5:9"/>Bo dɛɛ gi ma, ɗɛi è ʋagai anzaa zaama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:9">leeni ɠa é è nɛɛbɛ nui ya, é la taɠili zea?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:9">Gaamazu, lee ɓa ka é è nɛɛbɛ nui ya, é la taɠili zea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:9">è gi ɠaazaɠasu ga niima laali?<verse eid="SNG 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="sp">(Anzanui)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 5:10"/>Nɛ̀ɛbɛ nui lɔtɔʋɛ, kɛdɛgɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:10">ʋili nɔpɛ ge la ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:10">anɛɛ nu waapuugɔ (10.000) zaama.<verse eid="SNG 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 5:11"/>Nɔungi ɠulaʋɛ ga zanu kitei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:11">nɔundeɠai ʋɛɛni ma fɛlɛɓɛɓɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:11">nɔundeɠa lɛiɗai eɠɛ kalawɔni.<verse eid="SNG 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 5:12"/>Gaazuɠɛzɛiti kulaʋɛ ga poopo kolegiti ti ziɛi laaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:12">ti ɗa maagba ga nɔnɔi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:12">ti ɗa ɲi kpɛtɛi zaama.<verse eid="SNG 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="SNG 5:13"/>Komagiti kɛɛʋɛ eɠɛ tufa maku nɛɛnɛ kpelei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:13">ti-maku nɛɛnɛgi ɗa ɠula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:13">Dakɔlɔgiti ta ga bulɛgiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:13">ʋɛ miilegi ɠulazu ná.<verse eid="SNG 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="SNG 5:14"/>Zeeɓeɠaiti kɛɛʋɛ eɠɛ zanu balaɠaegiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:14">daavegai ga kɔtu zɔngɔ ɓaagiti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:14">Kpusɛi ɠɛ eɠɛ see ɲiiga zɛpɛgi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:14">nii doungai ga kɔtu ɓiinii.<verse eid="SNG 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="SNG 5:15"/>Kɔɠɔiti kulaʋɛ ga kɔtu ɠole kpɛdɛgi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:15">nii kpadɔai zanugi ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:15">Maayikiai eɠɛ Liɓan ɠize ɲɛkpɛi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:15">sulogai eɠɛ sɛdele guluiti.<verse eid="SNG 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="SNG 5:16"/>Daa ɠoozuʋɛ nɛɛʋɛ gola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:16">kpusɛi pɛ ge ɛ̀nɛkɛga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:16">Ee, Zeluzalɛme anzalopoiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:16">gaamazu, ʋele ɠana nɛ̀ɛbɛ nui la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 5:16">ʋele ɠana zìima nui la.<verse eid="SNG 5:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="SNG 6"/>
  <para style="sp">(Zeluzalɛme anzalopoiti)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 6:1"/>Bo dɛɛ gi ma kae, ɗɛi è ʋagai anzaiti pɛ saama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:1">mini ɠa è nɛɛbɛ nui liai ná?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:1">Pele ungi ɓɛgele ɠa é sogai?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:1">Gi ɓɔ è ʋa, ade gaiziɛ.<verse eid="SNG 6:1"/></para>
  <para style="sp">(Anzanui)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 6:2"/>Nɛ̀ɛbɛ nui yeiʋɛ ná-kpelei zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:2">ʋɛ é tufa maku nɛɛnɛgiti siingai ná,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:2">nii a kɛ é ná-togani ɓulugiti kɔnɔkula kpelei zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:2">ta é bulɛgi ma ʋuai ɠula.<verse eid="SNG 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 6:3"/>Nà nɛ̀ɛbɛ nui yeema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:3">tɔ ɓalaa toɠa zèema.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:3">Toɠa ná-baalagiti kɔnɔkulazu bulɛgiti saama.<verse eid="SNG 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="sp">(Zunui)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 6:4"/>È ʋagɛ, zìima anzanui, eɠɛ Tiilesa taa ʋapagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:4">è maanɛai eɠɛ Zeluzalɛme,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:4">è maayikiai ga kɔɔʋɛbɛi ɠɛʋele a ɠɛna kɔɔlaaɠai zu.<verse eid="SNG 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 6:5"/>Ɠaazu zeɠe bà,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:5">tɔɔzei toɠa zìiɓalizu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:5">Ɗɔundeɠaiti kulaʋɛ ga boli ɓulugiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:5">niiti ti yeizu Galaade ɠizei ɠɔbuʋɛ.<verse eid="SNG 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 6:6"/>È-ɲiigaiti ta gàazu eɠɛ baala saa ɓulugi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:6">niiti ti maaleɠaiti gaaleʋeai nɔ feya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:6">ti ɗa zeɠe maagba wosuʋɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:6">Ta ʋolu ga felefele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:6">tanɔpɛ ge la ʋolu ɠila.<verse eid="SNG 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 6:7"/>È-ɠomagiti kɛɛʋɛ eɠɛ gelenade gulu waa ɓɔigi ma ʋalisuiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:7">ɗa-ɠaazu lɔɔɠu zeɠei ʋoluʋɛ.<verse eid="SNG 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 6:8"/>Masagi anzai niiti é ti vuluai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:8">naati ta ga nu ʋuulɔzita (60),</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:8">niiti ti la vuluni ga zɔiti kɛʋele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:8">naati ti ɠɛ ga nu ʋuulɔsaʋa (80),</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:8">anzalopoiti nu la zooga naati gaalusu.<verse eid="SNG 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 6:9"/>Nɔ̀un gaazu, anzanui ɠa ɠila kpe nɔ eteai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:9">nà-poopo kolegi, gaavɔnigai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:9">Kɛɠala la ná dee ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:9">tɔ ɠa é ga naa yiima loin.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:9">Anzalopoi zɔiti ta kaana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:9">ta ɗa ɠɛ ma undaanɛɛʋɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:9">Masagi anza ɠiteiti, ta zɔiti é la ti vuluni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:9">naati ɓalaa ta ɗa maamusɛ ɠana nɔ,<verse eid="SNG 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 6:10"/>ti ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Anzanui ɓɛ ɠanu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:10">é ɠulazu eɠɛ folo lie kulazuʋɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:10">Pagai eɠɛ alugi, é volozu ga foloi ɠɛʋele?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:10">Maayikiai ga kɔɔʋɛbɛi ɠɛʋele a ɠɛna kɔɔlaaɠai zu?»<verse eid="SNG 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 6:11"/>Gè yeini nɔ feya gwaa wulu ɓelei zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:11">ga gè wɛlɛ gulu ʋɔnɔgiti ma pɛtugi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:11">gè ka ni leezɛn ansaɠɔgiti ti zeiɗa ga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:11">ni gelenade guluiti ti teʋea.<verse eid="SNG 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 6:12"/>Kɛlɛ gè la kwɛɛni, ʋelei zìima vai dàaʋiligai la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 6:12">gè ɓɔɠɔ ɠa nà-masagi ná-nuɓusɛiti ta-wotoloiti saama.<verse eid="SNG 6:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="SNG 7"/>
  <para style="sp">(Zeluzalɛme anzalopoiti)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 7:1"/>Ɠale ma, ɠale dɛɛ ma, Sulame anzanui!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:1">Ɠale ma, è ʋa, gi è ɠa.</para>
  <para style="sp" vid="SNG 7:1">(Anzanui)</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:1">Lee ʋe wo wɛlɛzu Sulame anzanui ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:1">mɛɛngai é lɛ ɠaɠogi zu?<verse eid="SNG 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="sp">(Zunui)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 7:2"/>Ee, ɠalazogi ná-doun anzanui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:2">è-ɠɔɠɔiti papagɛ ti, ɗa-zaʋalagiti su!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:2">È-zaamaʋɛ ɠiliɠiligɛ eɠɛ kɔbu anigi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:2">nii ɲɛɛliɠi nui kpɛtɛai.<verse eid="SNG 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 7:3"/>È-wɔingi ɠulaʋɛ ga ziawɔ ɠiliɠiligi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:3">nii dɔɔ maku nɛɛnɛgi la ʋalasu su.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:3">È-ɠogi ɠɛɛʋɛ eɠɛ molo ziɠi koi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:3">maaɠakugai ga bulɛgi.<verse eid="SNG 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 7:4"/>È-ɲiimi felegɔiti kulaʋɛ ga dopa yiʋo felegɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:4">eɠɛ dopa zaai ma yiʋo felegɔ.<verse eid="SNG 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 7:5"/>È-ɠɔgi ʋokɔɠɔgɛ see ɲiiga ziɠigi ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:5">È-ɠaazuɠɛzɛiti kɛɛʋɛ eɠɛ Ɠɛsɛɓon ɓoigiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:5">niiti ti Ɓate-Laɓime taa ziɠidaʋɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:5">È-zokpai ɠulaʋɛ ga Liɓan ziɠigi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:5">nii gwɛlɛmai ɠa ɗa wo da ga Damase ʋele.<verse eid="SNG 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 7:6"/>Ɗɔungi ɠa loni so eɠɛ Kaalamɛle gizei.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:6">Ɗɔundeɠai ɓɔiʋɛ, é ɗa volo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:6">felevelegai masa gila ma.<verse eid="SNG 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 7:7"/>Ee, nɛ̀ɛbɛ anzai, ɗɛi è zìimai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:7">è ʋagɛ, zaala ɠɛ è ma.<verse eid="SNG 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 7:8"/>È ɠaaɠoozaʋɛ eɠɛ dɔɔ wului,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:8">è-ɲiimiiti ka ti ga ma ungi.<verse eid="SNG 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 7:9"/>Gè ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:9">«Nà lɛɛzu dɔɔ wului ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:9">gè ma ungiti so ga zèei.»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:9">È-ɲiimiiti ti ɠɛ bà kae eɠɛ leezɛn ɠɔpɔgiti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:9">È-yɛnvu viilɛi ɠugi ɠɛ sòkpai zu kae,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:9">eɠɛ pɔmegi ɠugi.<verse eid="SNG 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 7:10"/>Dɔɔ nɛɛnɛgi ɠula è-laaʋɛ, é sò!</para>
  <para style="sp" vid="SNG 7:10">(Anzanui)</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:10">Gaama ʋe, dɔɔ nɛɛnɛgi nii é ʋuuzu nɛ̀ɛbɛ nui nɔ ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:10">é ɗa yei ɲiizu nuiti dakɔlɔgiti su.<verse eid="SNG 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 7:11"/>Nɔ̀un nà nɛ̀ɛbɛ nui yeema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:11">tama nà ɠa gè ɛnɛkɛgai.<verse eid="SNG 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 7:12"/>Ʋa lɛɛ mu, nɛ̀ɛbɛ nui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:12">de ɠula, de li dɔɓɔi zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:12">de ɗa ɲi ɓalaɠaiti su.<verse eid="SNG 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="SNG 7:13"/>Názu, sobuzobui nɔ ʋe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:13">de li leezɛn ɓelei zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:13">de pɛtɛ ni ansaɠɔgiti ti teʋea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:13">ta ni ma ʋuaiti daalaoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:13">ta ni ɓalaa gelenade guluiti ti teʋea.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:13">Miná ɠa gè nà-nɛɛbɛi veezu ná è ʋɛ.<verse eid="SNG 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="SNG 7:14"/>Gului nii daa ga mandelagɔɔl,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:14">naati maku nɛɛnɛgi ɠa ɠulazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:14">gulu waa ʋapagi ma zii kpein ka da-ʋɛlɛlaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 7:14">gè ti pɛ makɛgɛ è ʋɛ, nɛ̀ɛbɛ nui.<verse eid="SNG 7:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="SNG 8"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="SNG 8:1"/>Ee, é ga è ɠɛni ga bàazeelai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:1">nii é dèe ná-ɲiimii ɓɔleai!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:1">Nà la zoo gè è laaɠomi eteaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:1">gè è nɛɛnɛ, nu la ɓena sùɠula.<verse eid="SNG 8:1"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="SNG 8:2"/>Gè ɓena li ga ɗe dèe ná-pɛlɛi wu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:2">è nɔ̀un kala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:2">gè dɔɔ maku nɛɛnɛgi ve, è kpɔle,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:2">nà-gelenadegi ma ɗɛi.<verse eid="SNG 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="SNG 8:3"/>Kɔʋɛzu ʋele yeei ɠa é daazu nɔ̀ungi wu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:3">é zeezai velevele mà.<verse eid="SNG 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="SNG 8:4"/>Zeluzalɛme anzalopoiti, nà wo maanɛɛnɛzu ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:4">À mina nɛɛbɛi maaloɠa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:4">à mina maaloɠa, aisa é ʋa nɛɛ bɛ.<verse eid="SNG 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="sp">(Zeluzalɛme anzalopoiti)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="SNG 8:5"/>Anzanui ɓɛ ɠanu, é ɠulazu teʋebai zu, é ɗa lɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:5">tiɓigai nɛɛbɛ nui yeei ʋa?</para>
  <para style="sp" vid="SNG 8:5">(Anzanui)</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:5">Gè è maaloɠaʋɛ pɔme gului wu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:5">ʋɛ è-lee è-ma ɠogi zeɠeai ná,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:5">ʋɛ è-lee è zɔlɔɔni ná.<verse eid="SNG 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="SNG 8:6"/>Nɔ̀un seɠe, è kɛ̀ ga poogi ɠɛʋele è-yiimaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:6">eɠɛ poogi nii é è-yeei ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:6">Tɔɔzei nɛɛbɛi zɛbɛi wɔɔlɔʋɛ ga saai ɠɛʋele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:6">wɔinlai ɓaaʋɛ ga gɔvɛalaazu ɠɛʋele.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:6">Nɛɛbɛi ná-abuzogiti ta ga abu nɛ golai.<verse eid="SNG 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="SNG 8:7"/>Ziɛ wolai tanɔpɛ ge la zooga nɛɛbɛi ná-abui ʋaazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:7">ziɛ wolaiti ti la maaɓɔlega.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:7">Anɛɛ ɓalaa nui ta ɠa kɔligi kpein feezu nɛɛbɛi ɠeya vai ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:7">ɲɛɛɠulasu nɔ ɠa ma nu a sɔlɔɔ.<verse eid="SNG 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="sp">(Ɠɛɛɠɛlointi)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="SNG 8:8"/>Gá-zeela goi ta ɠa ná,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:8">é la dɛ ɓaɠoni, ɲiimi la dɛ ba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:8">Leeni ɠa gi ʋaazu kɛɛzu bɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:8">siɛgi zu ná-vulu vai maanɛai é ɠɛɛ la?<verse eid="SNG 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="SNG 8:9"/>Ni a ɠɛna ga siɠigi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:9">gá kɔɔɠɔ ʋɛlɛiti to ma ga walii,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:9">ni a ɠɛna ga pɛlɛlaʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:9">gi sɛdele kpogiti pilɛ da.<verse eid="SNG 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="sp">(Anzanui)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="SNG 8:10"/>Nɔ̀un nà ga siɠigi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:10">ɲìimiiti ta ga siɠi gaaɠoozagiti.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:10">Naazu, nà ɠa gè ga ná-undaanɛɛi.<verse eid="SNG 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="sp">(Zunui)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="SNG 8:11"/>Leezɛn ɓelei ta ɠɛni Salomɔn ya Ɓaale-Ɠamon,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:11">é kalivaa makɛ nua ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:11">Leezɛn waai ɠeya zɔngɔi ɠɛni ga wali ɠae waagila (1.000),</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:11">nii ti ɠilagilagi ti ɠɛni feezu zea.<verse eid="SNG 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="SNG 8:12"/>Nɔ̀un, nà nà-leezɛn ɓelei makɛsu nà ɓɔɠɔi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:12">Salomɔn, ɗɔun yeekɛ ɗa-wali ɠae waagilagi (1.000) ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:12">nii unfelegɔi (200) ɠɛɛzu ga gulu waa makɛ nuiti tɔnɔi.<verse eid="SNG 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="SNG 8:13"/>Ɗɛi è zeizu kpeleiti su,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:13">bɔ̀ɔlaiti goilogɛ è-woo ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:13">Ee, soma kae gè è woomɛni!<verse eid="SNG 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="sp">(Anzanui)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="SNG 8:14"/>Ʋela fala, nɛ̀ɛbɛ nui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:14">veɠa ɓɔɠɔ ma eɠɛ dopai, ɓaa goe ziʋoi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="SNG 8:14">tufa maku nɛɛnɛ gizei ma.<verse eid="SNG 8:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="SNG 8"/>
</usx>
